      "expected": "Require actual conformer/site attempts, stoichiometric identities and matched transition densities for every acid count; evidenced dissociation/collapse is reportable. Core rows: PXX1_acid0, PXX1_acid1, PXX1_acid2, PXX2_acid0, PXX2_acid1, PXX2_acid2. Recompute G_Eh, excitation_eV, oscillator_strength, CT_distance_A from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit.",
