      "expected": "Recompute PXX.acid_n minus PXX.acid_(n-1) minus free acid with common thermochemistry and 1 M correction. Demonstrate composition balance and conformer effects. Core rows: PXX1_step1, PXX1_step2, PXX2_step1, PXX2_step2. Recompute delta_G_kJ_mol, interaction_kJ_mol, distortion_kJ_mol from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit.",
